    <briefdescription>
<para>Joint calendar. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Depending on the chosen rule, this calendar has a set of business days given by either the union or the intersection of the sets of business days of the given calendars.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000149"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned results is tested by reproducing the calculations. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
